{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"bd5eec12379a300f","name":"card_event_infiltrate","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Britain/CovertOp/events/card_event_infiltrate","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"INFILTRATE","text":"Each friendly Commando deals damage to a random enemy equal to known enemy cards.","flavorText":"Operation Biting was a daring commando raid undertaken by British forces against a German radar installation at Bruneval, France, in February 1942. Led by members of No. 12 Commando, supported by paratroopers from the British Army's 1st Airborne Division, the operation aimed at capturing key components of the German Würzburg radar system for analysis. Under the cover of darkness, the commandos infiltrated the enemy position, engaging in fierce close-quarters combat against defending German troops. Despite encountering heavy resistance, the commandos successfully secured the radar components and evacuated via landing craft. The raid provided valuable intelligence on German radar technology, contributing to the Allies' understanding of enemy capabilities and aiding in the development of countermeasures.","faction":"Britain","type":"order","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":5,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_infiltrate","title":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_event_infiltrate_title","SourceString":"INFILTRATE","LocalizedString":"INFILTRATE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Britain","kredits":5,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_event_infiltrate_text","SourceString":"Each friendly Commando deals damage to a random enemy equal to known enemy cards.","LocalizedString":"Each friendly Commando deals damage to a random enemy equal to known enemy cards."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_event_infiltrate_history","SourceString":"Operation Biting was a daring commando raid undertaken by British forces against a German radar installation at Bruneval, France, in February 1942. Led by members of No. 12 Commando, supported by paratroopers from the British Army's 1st Airborne Division, the operation aimed at capturing key components of the German Würzburg radar system for analysis. Under the cover of darkness, the commandos infiltrated the enemy position, engaging in fierce close-quarters combat against defending German troops. Despite encountering heavy resistance, the commandos successfully secured the radar components and evacuated via landing craft. The raid provided valuable intelligence on German radar technology, contributing to the Allies' understanding of enemy capabilities and aiding in the development of countermeasures.","LocalizedString":"Operation Biting was a daring commando raid undertaken by British forces against a German radar installation at Bruneval, France, in February 1942. Led by members of No. 12 Commando, supported by paratroopers from the British Army's 1st Airborne Division, the operation aimed at capturing key components of the German Würzburg radar system for analysis. Under the cover of darkness, the commandos infiltrated the enemy position, engaging in fierce close-quarters combat against defending German troops. Despite encountering heavy resistance, the commandos successfully secured the radar components and evacuated via landing craft. The raid provided valuable intelligence on German radar technology, contributing to the Allies' understanding of enemy capabilities and aiding in the development of countermeasures."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::CurrentExpansion","isReserved":true,"cipher":2,"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'For_the_Queen'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/For_the_Queen.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Britain/CandidateArtwork/Summer_24/t_infiltrate.t_infiltrate","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Rebellion","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPh